SUMMARY:Independence Weekend: July 3rd Freedom Firework Food Truck Festival @ Haven Farms & July 4th BullCity Boom & Bash Food Truck Rodeo
DESCRIPTION:Savor Your City Independence Weekend Festival Series 🇺🇸🎆 \nGet ready for the ultimate Independence Weekend experience as Savor Your City brings you two unforgettable back-to-back festivals filled with energy\, culture\, and community. We’ll be at each location from 4-9pm with the show starting @ 9:10pm \nWe kick things off on July 3rd with the Freedom Fireworks Festival at Haven Farms—an immersive evening set on beautiful farm grounds. Enjoy a unique blend of entertainment and experience\, from a petting zoo and hands-on greenhouse & farming learning activities for kids\, to a vibrant marketplace and live music. As the night builds\, get ready for a spectacular fireworks show lighting up the sky. \nThen on July 4th\, we head to Durham for the Bull City Boom & Bash Food Truck Rodeo at Durham Central Park—a full-day celebration packed with flavor\, music\, and nonstop vibes in the heart of the city\, with nearby fireworks to close out the holiday. \nAcross both events\, expect an elevated festival atmosphere featuring: \n🎶 Two live DJs & line dancing\n🍔 BBQ\, Italian ice & diverse food vendors\n🍹 Drink vendors & refreshing summer sips\n🛍 Arts & crafts + local business vendors\n🌱 CBD & THC-friendly products grown and sold on-site\n🐐 Petting zoo & interactive farm experiences for kids\n🌿 Greenhouse tours & agricultural learning moments\n🎆 Fireworks experiences both nights\n💫 High-energy\, community-driven vibes all weekend \nWhether you’re coming for the food\, the music\, the family-friendly activities\, or the overall experience—this is more than a festival\, it’s a full weekend celebration of freedom\, culture\, and connection. \nPull up to one or both—but either way\, don’t miss the biggest weekend of the summer.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/independence-weekend-july-3rd-freedom-firework-food-truck-festival-haven-farms-july-4th-bullcity-boom-bash-food-truck-rodeo/
LOCATION:Haven Farms & Durham Central Park
CATEGORIES:Craft,Festival,Food Vendors/Food Trucks
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/dcd6d6b8-e6ab-4d38-a219-f6a674d4e26a-1.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Durham Central Park":MAILTO:noreply@facebookmail.com
END:VEVENT
